              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi aboolela Musa khu kaambila babaandu ba Isiraeli khuloondekhana ne khulekha khu takaasibwa nio balekhe khu nyaalutia Liiema lia Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi liliaba akari we kambi, busa bakhafwiile mu bwoni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
